OL,3,ATributes paid to drummer with dozens of
OL,4,Anumber ones
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid after the death
OL,7,Fof drummer Clem Cattini, who performed
OL,8,Fon several UK Number One singles.
OL,10,FThe 89-year-old, who lived in
OL,11,FHertfordshire, co-founded the Tornados
OL,12,Fin 1961. Their instrumental Telstar
OL,13,Fspent five weeks at the top of the UK
OL,14,Fchart in 1962, and they became the
OL,15,Ffirst British group to top the US
OL,16,FBillboard Hot 100.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
