OL,3,ATributes paid to drummer with dozens of
OL,4,Anumber ones
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a session musician, he played on
OL,7,Fnumber one hits such as Tom Jones'
OL,8,FGreen, Green Grass of Home, Dusty
OL,9,FSpringfield's You Don't Have To Say You
OL,10,FLove Me and Tony Christie's (Is This
OL,11,Fthe Way to) Amarillo?.
OL,13,FIn a Facebook post Christie described
OL,14,FCattini as "a world class musician but
OL,15,Falso a world class gentleman".
